66
00:04:33,950 --> 00:04:34,860
I will !

67
00:04:39,190 --> 00:04:41,310
Mu Yun
Demon General
Rank 150 000 Demonic Energy
(Late stage Soul Transformation)

68
00:04:39,470 --> 00:04:41,380
This person cultivates

69
