76
00:05:25,190 --> 00:05:27,510
Tian Lui
Giant Spirit Sect disciple
Late stage Soul Transformation

77
00:05:24,750 --> 00:05:26,060
This guy is strong,

78
00:05:26,070 --> 00:05:27,060
