117
00:07:29,750 --> 00:07:31,380
Stand to the side.

118
00:07:33,750 --> 00:07:35,860
Mo Lihai cannot fight

119
00:07:36,470 --> 00:07:37,460
but you...

120
00:07:38,070 --> 00:07:40,060
