121
00:07:43,390 --> 00:07:44,430
You !

122
00:07:44,670 --> 00:07:45,780
Come up.

123
00:07:55,470 --> 00:07:56,660
Vice-Commander Xuan,

124
00:07:56,670 --> 00:07:58,260
