146
00:08:55,310 --> 00:08:56,140
I'll go !

147
00:08:59,350 --> 00:09:01,590
Ao Di
Demon General
Rank 150 000 Demonic Energy
(Late stage Soul Transformation)

148
00:08:59,390 --> 00:09:01,340
Mo Lihai cannot fight

149
00:09:01,550 --> 00:09:03,580
