156
00:09:16,950 --> 00:09:18,070
You're noisy...

157
00:09:29,470 --> 00:09:31,300
Let's see how long you can dodge !

158
00:09:46,390 --> 00:09:47,500
You aren't

159
00:09:48,030 --> 00:09:49,340
a match for me.

160
00:09:49,670 --> 00:09:51,380
Ao Di isn't that strong.

161
00:09:51,870 --> 00:09:53,340
If it was Shi Xiao,

162
00:09:53,390 --> 00:09:54,910
he wouldn't have lasted a single move.

163
00:09:54,950 --> 00:09:55,790
Exactly !

164
00:09:55,790 --> 00:09:57,460
How ridiculous !

165
00:10:03,590 --> 00:10:05,060
In order to win,

166
00:10:05,270 --> 00:10:05,780
he...

167
00:10:06,230 --> 00:10:07,700
