169
00:10:27,910 --> 00:10:29,020
How could you possibly

170
00:10:29,470 --> 00:10:32,540
block my Demon Beast's Blood God Arrow !?

171
00:10:39,990 --> 00:10:40,580
You...

172
00:10:40,590 --> 00:10:41,580
