175
00:10:55,910 --> 00:10:56,580
Wang Lin !

176
00:10:56,750 --> 00:10:58,580
You have some nerve !

177
00:10:59,030 --> 00:11:01,260
The rules say I can't kill a Demon General.

178
00:11:01,710 --> 00:11:02,380
But...

179
00:11:02,910 --> 00:11:04,300
