182
00:11:09,390 --> 00:11:10,500
And ?

183
00:11:16,990 --> 00:11:18,030
You won

184
00:11:18,350 --> 00:11:19,580
this duel !

185
00:11:21,310 --> 00:11:23,100
Ao Di's helper !

186
00:11:23,190 --> 00:11:24,580
I... forfeit !

187
00:11:24,990 --> 00:11:25,900
I forfeit !

188
00:11:26,990 --> 00:11:28,220
He forfeited just like that ?

189
00:11:28,230 --> 00:11:29,020
Yeah...

190
00:11:30,110 --> 00:11:34,270
1 day later

191
00:11:43,470 --> 00:11:45,900
The winner is Mo Lihai.

192
00:11:46,390 --> 00:11:48,100
After 4 matches,

193
00:11:48,590 --> 00:11:50,180
Mo Lihai advances to the second round.

194
00:11:50,790 --> 00:11:52,380
Brother Wang, go back to the residence to rest.

195
00:11:52,470 --> 00:11:54,700
I'll still rely on you for the later rounds.

196
00:11:55,670 --> 00:11:58,380
That guy just bullies people in the name of the Emperor.

197
00:11:58,630 --> 00:12:00,460
Once Brother Wang gains the Demon Emperor's favor,

198
00:12:00,630 --> 00:12:01,980
he won't dare to say a word !

199
00:12:05,870 --> 00:12:06,660
Excuse me, excuse me.

200
00:12:12,910 --> 00:12:14,500
For her to seat beside the Demon Emperor...

201
00:12:15,590 --> 00:12:16,500
Could she be...

202
00:12:16,990 --> 00:12:18,460
The Demon Emperor's Sword Spirit !?

203
00:12:39,790 --> 00:12:41,350
Note: Little Black = Number Four

204
00:12:37,350 --> 00:12:37,860
Master,

205
00:12:38,390 --> 00:12:39,620
let Little Xu handle this !

206
00:12:39,790 --> 00:12:41,350
Little Black taught me a secret move,

207
00:12:41,350 --> 00:12:43,230
