212
00:12:59,190 --> 00:13:02,780
Little beauty, Brother Xu is coming to dote on you !

213
00:13:03,270 --> 00:13:04,820
What a filthy creature !

214
00:13:05,190 --> 00:13:06,140
Get away !

215
00:13:10,430 --> 00:13:13,510
Note: Xu Liguo had fallen in love with the soul fragment of Mei Ji (in the artifact of the Giant Demon Clan Ancestor)

216
00:13:10,430 --> 00:13:13,500
