220
00:13:20,790 --> 00:13:22,580
We are fated for each other.

221
00:13:29,950 --> 00:13:31,380
Disgusting !

222
00:13:33,070 --> 00:13:34,100
Don't go !

223
00:13:34,110 --> 00:13:35,980
You haven't finished your candied hawthorn yet !

224
00:13:34,110 --> 00:13:37,550
Note: candied hawthorn is the snack she was eating, it has a connotation of romance.

225
00:13:37,590 --> 00:13:38,420
My... my...

226
00:13:38,430 --> 00:13:40,300
My little beauty !!!

227
00:13:45,350 --> 00:13:47,700
My little beauty and I were about to get together

228
00:13:47,910 --> 00:13:48,570
and you...

229
00:13:48,590 --> 00:13:49,980
you tore us apart !

230
00:13:50,190 --> 00:13:50,780
Wang Lin,

231
00:13:50,990 --> 00:13:52,860
back then, you denied my love for the beauty in that artifact,

232
00:13:52,870 --> 00:13:54,900
and now you're stopping me from pursuing this love !

233
00:13:54,910 --> 00:13:57,060
You're just jealous of my dashing looks

234
00:13:57,070 --> 00:13:58,020
because you're all alone

235
00:13:58,030 --> 00:13:59,020
and can't stand to see others happy !

236
00:13:59,030 --> 00:14:00,070
Is that all ?

237
00:14:00,110 --> 00:14:00,780
I'm not done !

238
00:14:00,950 --> 00:14:03,340
Unless you let me out to find the little beauty I...

239
00:14:04,190 --> 00:14:05,020
My little beauty !

240
00:14:05,030 --> 00:14:06,580
Big brother is coming !

241
00:14:07,310 --> 00:14:08,220
As expected...

242
00:14:08,790 --> 00:14:11,350
My old restriction isn't strong enough to restrain him.

243
00:14:16,270 --> 00:14:17,180
Wang Lin...

244
00:14:17,510 --> 00:14:19,100
You're forcing my hand !

245
00:14:19,390 --> 00:14:20,180
Little Black,

246
00:14:20,190 --> 00:14:20,980
come out !

247
00:14:21,830 --> 00:14:23,060
Release the restriction immediately

248
00:14:23,070 --> 00:14:23,820
or else...

249
00:14:28,430 --> 00:14:32,100
The fiend's strength is getting more and more terrifying...

250
00:14:32,350 --> 00:14:33,620
But I will fight

251
00:14:33,990 --> 00:14:34,860
for my love !

252
00:14:34,870 --> 00:14:35,820
Little Black !

253
00:14:49,910 --> 00:14:50,300
Mas...

254
00:14:50,470 --> 00:14:50,980
Mas...

255
00:14:51,510 --> 00:14:52,750
Master...

256
00:14:53,270 --> 00:14:54,300
Are you done ?

257
00:14:55,870 --> 00:14:57,380
Master's cultivation is heavenly,

258
00:14:57,390 --> 00:14:59,420
Little Xu will never dare to betray you again.

259
00:15:05,390 --> 00:15:06,500
Master is so wise !

260
00:15:06,670 --> 00:15:09,020
I swear I'll never go find the little beauty again.

261
00:15:09,430 --> 00:15:11,460
Sky Demon City is filled with powerful experts.

262
00:15:11,790 --> 00:15:13,980
Did you think no one would see you ?

263
00:15:14,430 --> 00:15:15,580
With your strength,

264
00:15:15,710 --> 00:15:17,780
