276
00:15:43,270 --> 00:15:44,660
Cultivating them isn't easy...

277
00:15:45,070 --> 00:15:47,100
Master, please be merciful and let it stay.

278
00:15:53,670 --> 00:15:54,740
My little beauty...

279
00:15:55,270 --> 00:15:57,820
I wonder when we will meet again...

280
00:16:01,830 --> 00:16:02,420
Lord Wang,

281
00:16:02,710 --> 00:16:04,670
someone wishes to see you in the courtyard.

282
00:16:08,990 --> 00:16:10,390
The name of fellow cultivator Wang

283
00:16:10,430 --> 00:16:12,780
was already famous back on planet Tian Yun.

284
00:16:13,230 --> 00:16:15,580
I came here to express my gratitude.

285
00:16:16,590 --> 00:16:17,860
In today's Demon General competition

286
00:16:18,430 --> 00:16:19,630
you helped us understand

287
00:16:19,630 --> 00:16:21,020
how a cultivator should be.

288
00:16:21,590 --> 00:16:22,550
You flatter me.

289
00:16:23,630 --> 00:16:24,860
In the Demon Spirit Land,

290
00:16:25,310 --> 00:16:27,260
our lives are worthless.

291
00:16:27,590 --> 00:16:28,780
Demon Generals cannot be killed

292
00:16:28,990 --> 00:16:31,180
but helpers can be slaughtered.

293
00:16:31,790 --> 00:16:32,980
Only fellow cultivator Wang

294
00:16:33,270 --> 00:16:35,380
was able to repay them for that.

295
00:16:35,830 --> 00:16:37,230
Although military merit is important,

296
00:16:37,230 --> 00:16:38,790
we must be able to live through it !

297
00:16:38,830 --> 00:16:40,070
But this competition

298
00:16:40,110 --> 00:16:41,700
is just a way for them

299
00:16:41,790 --> 00:16:42,860
to sharpen their blades.

300
00:16:43,190 --> 00:16:45,220
Cultivators should act according to the situation,

301
00:16:45,230 --> 00:16:46,580
not obstinate over futile things.

302
00:16:47,190 --> 00:16:49,350
We have decided to withdraw from the competition.

303
00:16:49,390 --> 00:16:51,590
We came specially to bid farewell to fellow cultivator Wang.

304
00:16:56,510 --> 00:16:58,300
The Demon Generals are watching me like tigers.

305
00:16:58,910 --> 00:17:00,700
Jin Wuxu kept targeting me.

306
00:17:01,390 --> 00:17:03,260
This rule that Demon Generals can't be killed

307
00:17:03,990 --> 00:17:06,460
might as well be my death sentence.

308
00:17:08,270 --> 00:17:09,780
Act according to the situation...

309
00:17:10,670 --> 00:17:11,660
Perhaps...

310
00:17:12,230 --> 00:17:13,980
they are right.

311
00:17:50,510 --> 00:17:51,140
Ming Xuan,

312
00:17:51,830 --> 00:17:52,580
continue.

313
00:18:30,710 --> 00:18:33,500
From Qi Condensation all the way to Peak Late stage Soul Transformation,

314
00:18:34,190 --> 00:18:34,980
which step

315
00:18:35,790 --> 00:18:37,780
wasn't reached out of a desperate situation ?

316
00:18:37,790 --> 00:18:39,740
Cultivators should act according to the situation,

317
00:18:39,750 --> 00:18:40,940
not obstinate over futile things.

318
00:18:41,670 --> 00:18:43,100
If I had followed the will of the heavens,

319
00:18:43,430 --> 00:18:45,300
I wouldn't be alive today.

320
00:18:57,790 --> 00:18:58,580
Withdrawing

321
00:19:01,990 --> 00:19:03,060
is not an option,

322
00:19:03,990 --> 00:19:04,980
it's a grave.

323
00:19:11,990 --> 00:19:13,390
Defy the heavens with my actions.

324
00:19:17,590 --> 00:19:19,260
Defy the heavens by cultivating.

325
00:19:25,630 --> 00:19:27,220
Cultivate to defy.

326
00:19:30,790 --> 00:19:32,580
Cultivate for freedom.

327
00:19:34,390 --> 00:19:35,460
This is...

328
00:19:39,670 --> 00:19:40,900
my Dao !

329
00:19:54,790 --> 00:19:55,780
Defying

330
00:19:56,470 --> 00:19:58,700
is my path to the Ascendant realm.

331
00:20:00,070 --> 00:20:01,500
Such a Dao Heart...

332
00:20:02,390 --> 00:20:03,620
Perhaps he is the person

333
00:20:03,910 --> 00:20:05,780
the Ancestor has been waiting for.

334
00:20:26,710 --> 00:20:28,450
Accept your fate and stay mortal

335
00:20:29,470 --> 00:20:31,310
or defy it to become immortal !

336
00:20:34,940 --> 00:20:36,940
The heavens can't shake my Dao Heart

337
00:20:37,730 --> 00:20:39,730
so they will try to eradicate my existence !

338
00:20:40,530 --> 00:20:42,530
They can destroy my body,

339
00:20:42,950 --> 00:20:45,650
but they can't destroy my Dao Heart !

340
00:20:55,040 --> 00:20:57,040
If the heavens want to kill me...

341
00:20:58,150 --> 00:20:59,490
I will...

342
00:20:59,870 --> 00:21:01,670
destroy the heavens !

343
00:21:22,210 --> 00:21:24,710
Those who disturb my Ascendant breakthrough

344
00:21:25,040 --> 00:21:27,040
must die !

345
00:21:46,960 --> 00:21:48,960
Whoever wishes to kill me

346
00:21:49,300 --> 00:21:51,300
shall be trapped in my Underworld River,

347
00:21:51,990 --> 00:21:53,990
my own reincarnation cycle

348
00:21:54,760 --> 00:21:57,350
free from the heavens and the earth !
